  <data name="Lhdc_Missing" xml:space="preserve"><value>Downloads the drivers and backend EncoDeck compiles from LHDC-Win source, from EncoDeck's LHDC component release, verified by size and SHA-256. The component is independent of the app version, so updating EncoDeck does not download it again. Downloading does not install drivers.</value></data>
  <data name="Lhdc_Store" xml:space="preserve"><value>LHDC is unavailable in the Store edition. It requires separate drivers and a background service installed with administrator privileges. Experimental support is currently limited to the non-Store x64 edition and requires test-signed driver support.</value></data>
  <data name="Lhdc_Title.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>LHDC V5 (experimental)</value></data>
