  <data name="Lhdc_Architecture" xml:space="preserve"><value>The LHDC companion requires native x64 Windows and an x64 app.</value></data>
  <data name="Lhdc_Ready" xml:space="preserve"><value>EncoDeck controls the source-built LHDC-Win backend. Requires LHDC V5 earbuds and test-signed driver support. Applying and restoring audio requires administrator authorization; deployment verifies actual compatibility.</value></data>
