  <data name="Bridge_AssignTitle" xml:space="preserve"><value>Give {0} to A2DPWB?</value></data>
  <data name="Bridge_AssignBody" xml:space="preserve"><value>With WinUSB assigned, Windows no longer uses this adapter and any Bluetooth device on it disconnects. Administrator rights are needed; "Restore driver" gives it back to Windows at any time.</value></data>
