  <data name="About_FeedbackText.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>If the earbuds will not connect, a setting has no effect or the model is recognised wrongly, open an issue with the earbud model, firmware version, Windows version and the steps you took. Test results for models not yet verified are welcome too.</value></data>
