  <data name="About_ThanksLhdc.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>LHDC V5 component</value></data>
  <data name="Lhdc_Summary.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Installs an LHDC V5 driver on Windows' own Bluetooth so earbuds that support LHDC V5 can play at higher bitrates. The driver needs test-signed driver loading and is offered only in the non-Store x64 version.</value></data>
  <data name="About_ThanksIntro.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>EncoDeck builds on the work of these open-source projects. Thanks to their authors and contributors.</value></data>
  <data name="About_ThanksUsb.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>USB and 2.4 GHz gaming headsets</value></data>
