  <data name="About_ThanksBridge.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>A2DP Bridge component</value></data>
  <data name="About_ThanksLibraries.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>Libraries</value></data>
  <data name="About_ThanksAll.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>The third-party notices list every project with the revision used and its license.</value></data>
  <data name="About_PrivacyText.Text" xml:space="preserve"><value>EncoDeck has no accounts, ads, analytics or telemetry. It goes online only to check for updates, fetch device artwork and download the optional components you choose.</value></data>
